  "description": "Ops / alert-pipeline overview (#2463). Panels reference the alert-dispatch telemetry delivered by the alerts-GA workstream (#2468, honua_alerts_* on the shared Honua meter). Until that lands, these panels show 'No data' and degrade gracefully.",
  "editable": true,
